# Answer key for B10 t3_interaction.sql - lexical robustness, interaction.
#
# WRITTEN FROM SOURCE BEFORE THE ANALYSER WAS RUN OVER THIS FILE.
# Conventions: all earlier decisions, plus D-35..D-38 (decided 2026-10-04, not
# implemented). NOT EXPRESSIBLE IN A KEY, CHECKED IN THE REPORT: every PREPARE and the
# DEALLOCATE are counted with no edges; \set is not counted.

@ 28 S2 EXECUTE with a psql variable as its argument
value staging.customers.id -> mart.customer_summary.customer_id identity
value staging.customers.status, staging.customers.full_name, staging.customers.email -> mart.customer_summary.avg_basket conditional
value staging.customers.segment -> mart.customer_summary.full_name derived
filter staging.customers.country_code -> mart.customer_summary
note The CASE reads three columns (D-19), the <-> under it is derived (D-38), and the path is conditional (D-7).

@ 45 S4 EXECUTE the UPDATE
value staging.customers.segment -> mart.customer_summary.segment derived
filter staging.customers.status -> mart.customer_summary
note c.id = cs.customer_id joins the FROM relation to the target: structural (D-11, B3).

@ 68 S6 EXECUTE the MERGE
value staging.payments.order_id -> mart.top_customers.customer_id identity
value staging.payments.amount -> mart.top_customers.revenue aggregated
influence staging.payments.order_id -> mart.top_customers.revenue
filter staging.payments.amount -> mart.top_customers post
note The arm condition s.amt > $1 tests an aggregate: post-aggregation (D-6). ON is structural (D-5).

@ 90 S8 EXECUTE the writable CTE
value staging.events_log.id -> mart.events_log.id identity
value staging.events_log.kind -> mart.events_log.kind identity
filter staging.events_log.kind -> mart.events_log
value mart.events_log.id -> mart.kpi_rollup.orders identity
value mart.events_log.kind -> mart.kpi_rollup.level identity
filter staging.events_log.kind -> mart.kpi_rollup
note RETURNING gives the written table's columns (D-16); the CTE's WHERE filters both writes (D-17).

@ 96 S9 E'', U&'' and OPERATOR() in one WHERE
value staging.payments.method -> core.fct_payment.method identity
value staging.payments.amount -> core.fct_payment.amount identity
filter staging.payments.method, staging.payments.currency, staging.payments.amount -> core.fct_payment

@ 121 S11 EXECUTE without parentheses: the second body only
value staging.orders.id -> mart.channel_mix.orders aggregated
filter staging.orders.channel -> mart.channel_mix
forbid value staging.orders.customer_id -> mart.channel_mix.orders aggregated | the first p_r was deallocated before it was ever executed (D-35)

@ 138 S13 EXECUTE the prepared SELECT
value core.dim_warehouse.name -> <result>.name identity
value core.dim_warehouse.capacity -> <result>.cap derived
filter core.dim_warehouse.region, core.dim_warehouse.status -> <result>
